  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/617/header-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"175\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款包含抢械、任务、科技、Boss和动作姿势的冒险主题整合包。</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/620/description-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 本整合包通过枪械和生活质量提升模组，彻底改变你的原版体验。可与朋友联机或独自游玩。开始任务，收集战利品，击败Boss，赢取奖励。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按 I 键打开任务菜单，可阅读详细信息、领取奖励、购买物品，并在武器赌场中赢取大奖。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 使用枪匠台制作超过100种枪械和弹药。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按 K 键打开表情动作菜单，在朋友面前摆出各种姿势和表情。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按 L 键打开进度菜单，查看基于进度的任务和赌场内容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 针对低配系统优化（若帧率过低，请关闭光影）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 专为多人游戏打造。通过内置的Essential模组直接连接好友，或下载官方服务端包，搭建支持多人的完整服务器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 本整合包以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TacZ模组</a> 为基础，钻石作为主要货币。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/621/screenshots-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/606/2025-04-23_09-44-44-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/613/2025-04-23_10-44-20-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1183/6/2025-05-09_23-26-07-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/610/2025-04-23_10-47-40-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/611/2025-04-23_03-19-13-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1170/391/2025-04-27_02-46-51-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/612/2025-04-23_10-53-38-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1180/218/2025-05-07_09-27-45-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1184/294/2025-05-11_00-07-09-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p>欣赏来自TacZ模组的精彩内容：</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:1024px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bG9-8agYVyI\" width=\"1024\" height=\"601\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>查看本整合包中包含的部分GamerPotion模组：</p><div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkquesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/20/638809215458543440.png\" alt=\"DarkQuesting\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbindings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/22/638809215919453329.png\" alt=\"DarkBindings\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkrtp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/23/638809216123403947.png\" alt=\"DarkRTP\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkloot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/24/638809216321911073.png\" alt=\"DarkLoot\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkmining\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/123